<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62864" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λη-ΐς</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾱΐς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ΐδος, ἡ</span>, 
			Ep.
		 form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεία</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>booty, spoil</i>, mostly of
			cattle, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ληΐδα δ᾽ ἐκ πεδίου συνελάσσαμεν .
				. , πεντήκοντα βοῶν ἀγέλας, κτλ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				11.677
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Lac.</u>
				13.11
			</span></i>; then of all kinds of <i>booty</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.138
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				18.327
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				10.41
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλαζόμενοι κατὰ ληΐδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					3.106
				</span></i>
			: in <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				331
			</span></i> (lyr.), concrete for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰχμάλωτοι</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.695
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ληϊάς</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> without any notion of plunder,
				<i>cattle, stock</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεία</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ληΐδ᾽ ἀέξειν, βουκολίας τ᾽ ἀγέλας
					τεκαὶ αἰπόλιαπλατέ᾽ αἰγῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					444
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				25.97
			</span></i>.</div>
